 are examples of body language that can project confidence.\"\n    ],\n    [\n      \"Body Language\",\n      \"Conveys\",\n      \"Authority\",\n      \"Body language such as maintaining good posture and making direct eye contact can project authority in professional settings.\"\n    ],\n    [\n      \"Body Language\",\n      \"Conveys\",\n      \"Defensiveness\",\n      \"Crossing one\\\"s arms is a common body language gesture that can signal defensiveness or discomfort.\"\n    ],\n    [\n      \"Body Language\",\n      \"Conveys\",\n      \"Agreement\",\n      \"Nodding is a body language gesture that can indicate agreement or understanding.\"\n    ],\n    [\n      \"Body Language\",\n      \"Conveys\",\n      \"Attraction\",\n      \"Romantic body language, such as touching, gazing, and mirroring gestures, can signal attraction and intimacy between individuals.\"\n    ],\n    [\n      \"Body Language\",\n      \"Conveys\",\n      \"Intimacy\",\n      \"Romantic body language, such as touching, gazing, and mirroring gestures, can signal attraction and intimacy between individuals.\"\n    ],\n    [\n      \"Body Language\",\n      \"Conveys\",\n      \"Attentiveness\",\n      \"Maintaining eye contact during a conversation can signal attentiveness and engagement.\"\n    ],\n    [\n      \"Body Language\",\n      \"Conveys\",\n      \"Discomfort\",\n      \"Avoiding eye contact may suggest discomfort or dishonesty.\"\n    ],\n    [\n      \"Body Language\",\n      \"Conveys\",\n      \"Happiness\",\n      \"A smile is often associated with happiness or friendliness.\"\n    ],\n    [\n      \"Body Language\",\n      \"Conveys\",\n      \"Friendliness\",\n      \"A smile is often associated with happiness or friendliness.\"\n    ],\n    [\n      \"Body Language\",\n      \"Conveys\",\n      \"Confusion\",\n      \"A furrowed brow may indicate confusion or concern.\"\n    ],\n    [\n      \"Body Language\",\n      \"Conveys\",\n      \"Concern\",\n      \"A furrowed 